Package: cigamingos-welcome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CiGaming <admin@snugglesmp.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: cigamingos-branding (= @VERSION@), python3, python3-pyqt6, flatpak, xdg-utils
Recommends: qt6-wayland
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: CiGaming OS first-login welcome app
 Opens once on a new user's first login: pick apps to install from
 Flathub, set up Twitch, and join the SnuggleSMP Minecraft community.
 Re-open it any time from the app menu ("Welcome to CiGaming OS").
 .
 Settings: /etc/cigamingos/welcome.conf and welcome-apps.json.
